<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets one-week rev repo, limit 17.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets one-week rev repo, limit 17.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech central bank on Tuesday set a one-week reverse repo tender to drain funds at a limit rate of 17.9 percent, down from 18.2 percent in its last similar operation on Monday.</p>
<p>The CNB said it would take two bids at a minimum of 100 million crowns before the deadline of 10:05 a.m. (0805 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
